Description: Unnamed - 4k intro by piRro & fx (2004)
 Unnamed is a 4096-byte C source intro by piRro and fx, entered in the
 2004 4k source compo of 320x200.org. Written with SDL 1.2, it shows
 plasmas, a Sierpinski fractal and spheres made of squares, on a cover of
 the Zelda main theme synthesised in real time.
